```lean
theorem no_infinite_steps (step : ℕ → Prop) (complexity : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hdec : ∀ n, step n → complexity (n + 1) < complexity n) :
    ¬ ∀ n, step n :=
  fun h => no_infinite_strict_decrease complexity fun n => hdec n (h n)
```
